          "text": "The address is 98 King Street. Can I help you with anything else?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "Yes. I'm also looking for a moderately priced restaurant that serves Turkish food."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "Anatolia is a good choice. It is at 30 Bridge Street, City Centre, postcode CB2 1UJ. Would you like to book a table?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "Is it in the same area as the gallery? I'm not familiar with the town."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "Yes. It is also in the centre of town."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "Great. Please make a reservation for two people on Sunday."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "Okay. I'll make the reservation for two people on Sunday."
        }
